  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/1",
      "verbatimFragment": "\"hero/skill/6012/1\",\"Witch places a cauldron that spills a cloud of poison for ${cfg.args.duration/1000} seconds, dealing ${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}% ATK) Poison DMG.\""
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/2",
      "verbatimFragment": "\"hero/skill/6012/2\",\"Witch places a cauldron that spills a cloud of poison for ${cfg.args.duration/1000} seconds, dealing ${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}% ATK) Poison DMG and applying [Poisoning]. [Poisoning: Deals ${cfg.BuffDamage}(${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.args}% ATK) Poison DMG and loses STA every sec]\""
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/3",
      "verbatimFragment": "'hero/skill/6012/3',\"Passive: For each Poison weapon equipped, ATK increases by +10%\\nWitch places a cauldron that spills a cloud of poison for ${cfg.args.duration/1000} seconds, dealing ${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}% ATK) Poison DMG and applying [Poisoning]. [Poisoning: Deals ${cfg.BuffDamage}(${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.args}% ATK) Poison DMG and loses STA every sec]\""
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/1",
      "verbatimFragment": "\"hero/skill/6012/1\",'女巫放置魔法坩埚，${cfg.args.duration/1000}秒内不断发射追踪毒液，造成${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}%攻击力)点毒属性伤害。'"
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/2",
      "verbatimFragment": "\"hero/skill/6012/2\",\"女巫放置魔法坩埚，${cfg.args.duration/1000}秒内不断发射追踪毒液，造成${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}%攻击力)点毒属性伤害，并施加【中毒】效果。【中毒：每秒造成${cfg.BuffDamage}(${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.args}%攻击力）点毒属性伤害并扣除${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.propValue}点体力】\""
    },
    {
      "language": "zh",
      "key": "hero/skill/6012/3",
      "verbatimFragment": "\"hero/skill/6012/3\",\"被动：武器栏每装备一把毒属性武器，攻击力增加10%\\n女巫放置魔法坩埚，${cfg.args.duration/1000}秒内不断发射追踪毒液，造成${cfg.TotalDamage}(${cfg.args.damage/100}+${cfg.args.atkArgs}%攻击力)点毒属性伤害，并施加【中毒】效果。【中毒：每秒造成${cfg.BuffDamage}(${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.args}%攻击力）点毒属性伤害并扣除${cfg.onHitEnemyBuffArgs.propValue}点体力】\""
    }
  ],
